    "path": "/strings/info/1",
    "raw": "Select a research by clicking one of the icons on the grid.\nYou can navigate the grid by dragging with the left mouse button.\n\n- The topmost button at the right corner closes the research interface.\n\n- The second button opens a list of research trees to pick from.\n\n- The third button opens a list of non-hidden research options. Click a research on the displayed to center the view on it. Click again to hide the list.\n\n- The fourth button will center the view on the middle of the tree, or the currently selected research.\n\n- The last button toggles ^orange;low quality mode^reset;. This makes the GUI jump to a position instead of panning to it, or the center button. In addition, dragging/navigating on the the main screen will update only after you release the mouse button. It is best to use the search list with this mode enabled.",
    "value": "通过点击网格上的图标来选择一项研究。\n您可以通过按住鼠标左键拖动来导航网格。\n\n- 右上角最顶部的按钮用于关闭研究界面。\n\n- 第二个按钮用于打开可供选择的研究树列表。\n\n- 第三个按钮用于打开非隐藏的研究选项列表。点击列表中显示的研究项，可将视图居中定位到该研究的图标上。再次点击该按钮可隐藏列表。\n\n- 第四个按钮用于将视图居中定位到科技树的中心，或者当前选中的研究项目上。\n\n- 最后一个按钮用于切换 ^orange;低质量模式^reset;。此模式下，界面将直接跳转到目标位置，而非通过平移动画（搜索列表或居中按钮触发的动画）移动。此外，在主屏幕上的拖动导航操作，仅在释放鼠标按钮后才会更新视图。建议在此模式下使用搜索列表功能。"
